    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104790" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐᾱκοσταῖος</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐηκ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the thirtieth day,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; <i>in thirty days,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. περιώδευσε τὴν Σύρτιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					17.3.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκαι -ταῖαι</span> cases
				<i>which must be tried within thirty days,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Tab.Heracl.
				1.49
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>thirty days old,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phylarch.
					36
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
